00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,784
The traveller was waiting at a station when she noticed something interesting.

2
00:00:04,734 --> 00:00:10,731
Some people were getting upset, but one calm, polite request changed the situation.

3
00:00:10,731 --> 00:00:15,784
She began collecting stories about ordinary objects and human behaviour.

4
00:00:15,784 --> 00:00:20,372
She wanted to understand why small changes can make a big difference.

